  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You were a skilled craftsman, experienced in the shaping and building of wooden structures. Carpentry is a well respected and honest trade, and carpenters take pride in their craft.</p>\n<p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> 2 from Athletics, Acrobatics, Survival, History</p>\n<p><strong>Tool Proficiencies:</strong> Woodcarver's and Carpenter's tools</p>\n<p><strong>Equipment:</strong> 150,000 Berries; Small Medkits &times;3; Rations &times;5, your choice of Woodcarver's or Carpenter's Tools, a wooden trinket, several blueprints</p>\n<h4>Feature: Wood Artisan</h4>\n<p>You know how to work with wood. You gain your choice of the Master Carpenter Feat or the Master Woodcarver Feat.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
